9-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "6757908704317420", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_6757908707650753_3424585239064189609_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PoH4W4qT_HkQ7kNvwGC-jv2&_nc_oc=AdlEHJHbhxiGs-2WGYx4vz60CHjkUuuG1tmCfRk1GCXNrBErVoHj66vsHAQuTUD-qa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx1ALUYp1zUryvo2Pi3vDa_Ajw2VmZ1PJDZux_SZNihRA&oe=69BD5028"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "312845394416247", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035359_312845397749580_7295644085646795585_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KxBA6-NQn64Q7kNvwHcZP5g&_nc_oc=Adn2XGLXDZ1YJxo4RoYLx9A6g5e7tYjlbxDdeHS84q-m4GlfbVqOH1u4vZ6RwjsQ9Cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyZqwUO20FwkuR8Ih_fztShSF5RWLp-n34p9Sd7zgvifg&oe=69BD34F9"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stardustcollective.dev/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Stardust Collective", "support_website_url": "https://www.stardustcollective.dev/support", "website_url": "https://www.stardustcollective.dev/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITT